WEBVTT

1
00:00:14.270 --> 00:00:17.311
think that mystery man wants to kidnap William?"

2
00:00:17.911 --> 00:00:20.232
Henry wasn't so sure about Cole's idea.

3
00:00:20.252 --> 00:00:23.514
"That kind of thing doesn't happen in Belltown."

4
00:00:23.534 --> 00:00:27.396
"Daisy said William's family is rich," Cole said.

5
00:00:28.412 --> 00:00:32.854
"Or maybe the mystery man is mad about something William's dad did as a senator.

6
00:00:33.714 --> 00:00:35.675
And that's why he wants to kidnap William!"

7
00:00:36.675 --> 00:00:37.816
Maggie looked excited.

8
00:00:37.836 --> 00:00:40.237
"This could be our biggest case yet!"

9
00:00:40.257 --> 00:00:44.318
"But what does kidnapping have to do with slashing tires?"

10
00:00:44.779 --> 00:00:45.499
Henry asked.

11
00:00:45.519 --> 00:00:52.522
"Maybe the mystery man was trying to distract everyone so he'd have a chance to nab William," said

12
00:00:52.622 --> 00:00:54.402
Cole. "Maybe."

13
00:00:54.803 --> 00:00:56.103
Henry thought for a second.

14
00:00:56.823 --> 00:00:57.884
Then he shook his head.

15
00:00:59.228 --> 00:01:01.390
"I'm still not sure I believe any of this.

16
00:01:02.070 --> 00:01:03.991
But Maggie is right about one thing.

17
00:01:04.972 --> 00:01:08.514
This case is much more serious than our usual cases.

18
00:01:09.275 --> 00:01:10.956
We should warn William right away.

19
00:01:11.917 --> 00:01:13.097
Then we need to tell Ms.

20
00:01:13.117 --> 00:01:15.359
Hernandez." Cole nodded.

21
00:01:15.379 --> 00:01:17.020
"Let's go find William."

22
00:01:18.821 --> 00:01:23.204
The Lemonade Detectives wandered through the crowd, but William was nowhere to be seen.

23
00:01:24.245 --> 00:01:25.706
Finally Maggie spotted him.

24
00:01:26.446 --> 00:01:28.728
He'd wandered off by himself into the woods.

25
00:01:29.961 --> 00:01:31.102
They jogged toward him.

26
00:01:33.164 --> 00:01:34.325
William saw them coming.

27
00:01:34.345 --> 00:01:37.768
"Oh, it's you," he said uneasily.

28
00:01:37.788 --> 00:01:40.670
"Did you come to knock over my bag again?"

29
00:01:40.690 --> 00:01:46.055
"No, we came to warn you that someone might be trying to kidnap you," Cole said.

30
00:01:46.075 --> 00:01:49.618
"Have you noticed that stranger with the dark glasses?"

31
00:01:49.638 --> 00:01:51.920
"He's been following you!"

32
00:01:52.300 --> 00:01:52.961
Maggie added.

33
00:01:52.981 --> 00:01:56.124
"We're afraid he wants to kidnap you for ransom."

34
00:01:57.388 --> 00:01:59.289
For a second William just stared at them.

35
00:01:59.929 --> 00:02:01.190
Then he started laughing.

36
00:02:02.150 --> 00:02:03.431
Henry was confused.

37
00:02:04.111 --> 00:02:06.732
That definitely wasn't the reaction he was expecting!

38
00:02:06.752 --> 00:02:08.893
"What's so funny?"

39
00:02:09.313 --> 00:02:09.833
he asked.

40
00:02:10.794 --> 00:02:11.914
William kept laughing.

41
00:02:12.554 --> 00:02:14.015
Then he turned and walked away.

42
00:02:14.035 --> 00:02:16.056
"Hold on a minute!"

43
00:02:16.716 --> 00:02:17.996
Maggie stomped after him.

44
00:02:18.016 --> 00:02:20.297
"We're trying to help you!

45
00:02:20.317 --> 00:02:23.279
The least you can do is tell us what's so funny!"

46
00:02:26.604 --> 00:02:28.385
"Okay." William finally stopped laughing.

47
00:02:28.405 --> 00:02:30.166
"You don't have to worry.

48
00:02:30.826 --> 00:02:32.467
That guy isn't trying to kidnap me."

49
00:02:32.487 --> 00:02:34.448
"How do you know?"

50
00:02:34.889 --> 00:02:35.629
Henry asked.

51
00:02:36.509 --> 00:02:39.311
For a second he thought William was going to walk away again.

52
00:02:40.251 --> 00:02:42.112
Then Maggie poked William in the shoulder.

53
00:02:42.132 --> 00:02:43.433
"Tell us!"

54
00:02:43.953 --> 00:02:44.494
she ordered.

55
00:02:44.514 --> 00:02:48.536
"While you're at it, tell us why you're here," Cole added.

56
00:02:48.556 --> 00:02:51.177
"We know you didn't want to come on this ride."

57
00:02:52.138 --> 00:02:53.098
William frowned.

58
00:02:53.118 --> 00:02:55.700
"I did want to come," he said.

59
00:02:56.340 --> 00:02:57.901
"Well, I wanted to come at first.

60
00:02:59.022 --> 00:03:01.903
I thought it would be a good way to meet people since I'm new around here."

61
00:03:02.844 --> 00:03:03.544
Henry nodded.

62
00:03:03.564 --> 00:03:05.285
"That makes sense.

63
00:03:05.885 --> 00:03:08.166
But you don't look like you're having much fun."

64
00:03:08.186 --> 00:03:11.128
"That's because of Chuck," William said.

65
00:03:11.148 --> 00:03:12.769
"Who's Chuck?"

66
00:03:13.149 --> 00:03:13.889
Maggie asked.

67
00:03:13.909 --> 00:03:16.431
"The guy with the dark glasses."

68
00:03:16.851 --> 00:03:17.831
William hesitated.

69
00:03:17.851 --> 00:03:20.493
"He's my "Your what?"

70
00:03:20.833 --> 00:03:21.734
Maggie prompted him.

71
00:03:22.794 --> 00:03:23.615
William sighed.

72
00:03:23.635 --> 00:03:26.036
"My bodyguard."

73
00:03:27.108 --> 00:03:28.709
"What?" Cole exclaimed.

74
00:03:28.729 --> 00:03:32.170
"My parents made him come with me," William said.

75
00:03:32.190 --> 00:03:36.111
"We're new here so they weren't sure if the trail ride was safe for me.

76
00:03:37.111 --> 00:03:40.472
I didn't want everyone to think I was some weird rich kid with a bodyguard.

77
00:03:41.352 --> 00:03:42.853
So I decided not to come at all.

78
00:03:43.733 --> 00:03:45.713
But then my parents wouldn't let me back out."

79
00:03:46.454 --> 00:03:47.074
He shrugged.

80
00:03:47.094 --> 00:03:50.275
"Chuck promised he'd try to blend in with the other riders.

81
00:03:50.975 --> 00:03:52.075
But it didn't really work."

82
00:03:53.115 --> 00:03:53.916
Maggie giggled.

83
00:03:55.904 --> 00:03:57.706
"Yeah. He sort of stands out in the crowd."

84
00:03:58.646 --> 00:04:00.047
That made the others laugh too.

85
00:04:00.828 --> 00:04:02.049
Even William smiled.

86
00:04:03.110 --> 00:04:06.733
Now Henry understood why Chuck had lied to them about being a reporter.

87
00:04:07.653 --> 00:04:09.455
He'd been trying to protect William.

88
00:04:10.336 --> 00:04:12.017
William suddenly looked nervous.

89
00:04:12.037 --> 00:04:14.319
"Are you guys going to tell everyone?"

90
00:04:15.320 --> 00:04:16.841
"No way," Cole said.

91
00:04:16.861 --> 00:04:18.702
"Your secret's safe with us."

92
00:04:19.703 --> 00:04:20.444
Maggie nodded.

93
00:04:20.464 --> 00:04:22.005
"You can trust us.

94
00:04:22.665 --> 00:04:23.666
We're professionals."

95
00:04:23.686 --> 00:04:25.608
"Professional what?"

96
00:04:25.972 --> 00:04:26.773
William asked.

97
00:04:27.713 --> 00:04:29.474
"Detectives," Henry said.

98
00:04:29.494 --> 00:04:33.856
"Which reminds me—we have to hurry if we want to solve this case!"

99
00:04:33.876 --> 00:04:35.577
"What case?

100
00:04:36.358 --> 00:04:37.919
We have no suspects!"

101
00:04:38.439 --> 00:04:39.480
Maggie reminded him.

102
00:04:39.500 --> 00:04:43.122
"Maybe we can interview everyone again," Cole said.

103
00:04:43.142 --> 00:04:46.664
"Someone must have seen something suspicious!"

104
00:04:46.684 --> 00:04:50.666
"What about those two kids who keep sneaking into the woods together?"

105
00:04:50.986 --> 00:04:51.866
William asked.

106
00:04:51.886 --> 00:04:54.348
"That seems kind of suspicious."

107
00:04:55.328 --> 00:04:56.249
"What two kids?"

108
00:04:56.669 --> 00:04:57.469
Henry asked.

109
00:04:58.469 --> 00:04:59.270
William shrugged.

110
00:04:59.290 --> 00:05:01.030
"I don't know who they are.

111
00:05:01.751 --> 00:05:04.392
Some teenage guy and girl wearing school T-shirts."

112
00:05:05.432 --> 00:05:07.973
"Hi, guys," Nathan said, walking over.

113
00:05:07.993 --> 00:05:09.554
"What's going on?"

114
00:05:09.574 --> 00:05:12.875
"We were just talking to William," Henry said.

115
00:05:12.895 --> 00:05:15.236
"William, this is Nathan."

116
00:05:15.256 --> 00:05:18.677
"Hi." Nathan was friendly to everyone.

117
00:05:18.697 --> 00:05:20.858
"Are you new in Belltown?"

118
00:05:21.719 --> 00:05:24.840
Henry left the two of them chatting and dragged his friends aside.

119
00:05:25.912 --> 00:05:28.273
"Who do you think William saw sneaking around?"

120
00:05:28.634 --> 00:05:29.094
he said.

121
00:05:29.114 --> 00:05:31.415
"Did we miss some suspects?"

122
00:05:31.435 --> 00:05:34.297
"Maybe." Maggie shrugged.

123
00:05:34.317 --> 00:05:38.018
"But it was probably just high school kids sneaking away to kiss."

124
00:05:39.099 --> 00:05:42.501
Just then Henry heard the sound of rustling leaves deeper in the woods.

125
00:05:43.521 --> 00:05:44.342
Cole heard it too.

126
00:05:44.362 --> 00:05:45.562
"What's that?

127
00:05:46.283 --> 00:05:47.143
A deer or something?"

128
00:05:48.004 --> 00:05:50.985
Henry saw a flash of bright red and gold through the trees.

129
00:05:51.005 --> 00:05:55.468
"No, it's a Valley High person—or people.

130
00:05:56.385 --> 00:05:56.747
Come on.

131
00:05:57.450 --> 00:05:58.918
This could be our last chance!"
